 simple RNN and LSTM neural networks. However, the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks could predict the target sequence perfectly with fewer recurrent units than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":174623,"global_rank":443834},{"name":"ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","owner":"ianliuy","html_url":"https://github.com/ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":174623,"global_rank":443835},{"name":"atkatchev/Deep_Learning_Nanodegree","owner":"atkatchev","html_url":"https://github.com/atkatchev/Deep_Learning_Nanodegree","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Deep Learning Nanodegree Projects","topics":[],"score":174620,"global_rank":443836},{"name":"atkatchev/Artificial_Intelligence_Programming_with_Python_Nanodegree","owner":"atkatchev","html_url":"https://github.com/atkatchev/Artificial_Intelligence_Programming_with_Python_Nanodegree","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Artificial Intelligence Programming with Python Nanodegree Projects","topics":[],"score":174620,"global_rank":443837},{"name":"andrewbastian/node-api4","owner":"andrewbastian","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewbastian/node-api4","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":174620,"global_rank":443838},{"name":"arorasaransh/SQLZoo","owner":"arorasaransh","html_url":"https://github.com/arorasaransh/SQLZoo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"SQL queries answered using data and questions from https://sqlzoo.net/wiki/SQL_Tutorial","topics":["ms-sql","ms-sql-queries"],"score":174620,"global_rank":443839},{"name":"adityar003/Website","owner":"adityar003","html_url":"https://github.com/adityar003/Website","stars":0,